  "notes": "{配信|はいしん} is commonly used for digital content distribution and online streaming.\n\nCOMPONENTS:\n{配|はい} (distribute) + {信|しん} (message/transmission) = distribution/streaming\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {動画|どうが}{配信|はいしん}: video streaming\n- ライブ{配信|はいしん}: live streaming\n- {音楽|おんがく}{配信|はいしん}: music streaming\n- {配信|はいしん}サービス: streaming service\n- {配信|はいしん}{開始|かいし}: start of distribution\n- {配信|はいしん}{停止|ていし}: suspension of distribution\n\nMODERN USAGE:\nWith the rise of platforms like YouTube, {配信|はいしん} has become synonymous with online content creation. {配信者|はいしんしゃ} refers to a streamer or content creator.\n\nRELATED:\n{放送|ほうそう} (broadcast) is used for traditional TV/radio, while {配信|はいしん} implies internet-based delivery.",
